From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 01:39:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03938/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE A4 (ARC
 NORTH STAR; operator MANDATORY 2026-06-24 leader-gap "highest-leverage, build
 it") -- CORRECTED goal-free ONLINE ACTION-LEARNING DRIVER (the
 StochasticGoose leader's loop). The .433 attempt (exp4710 arms) nulled at
 0.04 flat BUT on a CNN dict-candidate SILENT BUG and over a dead Go-Explore
 archive. Build the CORRECTED loop: an online binary-frame-change CNN with a
 COORDINATE HEAD that PROPOSES clicks (hierarchical action-then-coord sample,
 NOT a re-ranker), self-supervised free labels (frame_changed), Adam lr=1e-4
 BCE every ~5 actions, hash-deduped buffer, reward-driven per-level reset to
 the cross-game PRIOR (not random). Cheap floor (may ship first): flip
 gated_engine_from_transitions default to trust_metric=cell_recall so the
 existing online CNN un-gates. A/B {{frozen, online-scratch, online-warm}}.
 Gate: online-warm beats frozen by >=+0.05 held-out first-win AND a
 multi-level probe reaches L2 offline-reproduced. CPU train-step wall-clock
 MEASURED (Kaggle viability). live_agent_self_discovery.
 verifier_is_oracle:false. retire_if_same_verdict.

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
